{"sections":[{"slug":"景上的层","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"景上的层"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">景上的层</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"景上的层"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的层</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">就是这个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">所</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数学对象的表现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的对象</span>.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的层是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑空间上的层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">逐元素定义</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $(C,J)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":", $P\\colon C^{\\text{op}}\\to \\mathsf {Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的预层</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定一个对象</span> $c\\in C$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及覆盖筛</span> $S \\in J(c)$. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">相容族</span></strong> (matching family) <span lang=\"zh\">是如下资料</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的每个</span> $f\\colon d\\to c$ <span lang=\"zh\">指定一个元素</span> $x_f\\in P(D)$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span>\n$$\r\nx_f\\cdot g := P(g)(x_f) = x_{fg},\\quad \\forall g\\colon e\\to d.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">上式可形象地表示为下图的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">相容性</span>”.\n$$\r\ne \\overset{g}{\\to} d \\overset{f}{\\to} c \\overset{x}{\\leadsto} P\r\n$$</p>\n<p>(todo)</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">范畴论定义</span></h3>\n<p>(todo)</p>\n"}]}}}]}